\f0\b0 \
\
  The token shown on API Setup expires after 24 hours, so make a permanent one:\
  1. Go to 
\f2\b business.facebook.com \uc0\u8594  Settings \u8594  Users \u8594  System users \u8594  Add
\f0\b0 , and create an 
\f2\b Admin
