\f2\b app
\f0\b0  and of the 
\f2\b WhatsApp account
\f0\b0 .\
  3. Click 
\f2\b Generate token
\f0\b0 . Choose the app, set expiry to 
\f2\b Never
\f0\b0 , and tick \cf3 whatsapp_business_messaging\cf2  and\
     \cf3 whatsapp_business_management\cf2 .\
  4. Copy the token now; Meta only shows it once.\
