  - 
\f2\b Category:
\f0\b0  Authentication\
  - 
\f2\b Name:
\f0\b0  \cf3 nabd_login_otp\cf2 \
  - 
\f2\b Language:
\f0\b0  English (\cf3 en\cf2 )\
  - 
\f2\b Code delivery:
\f0\b0  
\f2\b Copy code
\f0\b0  button\
  \
