\f2\b 10. Check it works
\f0\b0 \
\
  1. Request a login code. It should arrive on WhatsApp, and the backend log should also show \cf3 [OTP] \'85\cf2 .\
  2. Create a template in 
\f2\b Setup \uc0\u8594  WhatsApp
\f0\b0 . Its status should change to approved or rejected on its own.\
  3. If webhooks have no effect, look for \cf3 401\cf2  in the backend log. That means the App Secret is wrong or missing.\
